{"id":"435152fdfa38036a","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-stlc-syntax.md","title":"有限积简单类型演算","display":"df-stlc-syntax — 有限积简单类型演算","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"2","label":"16-df-stlc-syntax","aliases":["16-df-stlc-syntax","STLC syntax and conversion"],"display":"df-stlc-syntax — 有限积简单类型演算","depends_on":[],"source":"§2.3, pp. 134–140 (PDF 154–160); derived-type constants and equational specifications are explicit local extensions","review_status":"source-rules-and-local-reconstruction","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-stlc-syntax"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-stlc-syntax</span><span>STLC syntax and conversion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-stlc-syntax — 有限积简单类型演算"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source","html":"§2.3, pp. 134–140 (PDF 154–160); derived-type constants and equational specifications are explicit local extensions"},{"key":"review_status","html":"source-rules-and-local-reconstruction"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,C\">\\(B,C\\)</span> 是集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 的元素为互异的基本类型符号，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 的元素为互异的常量符号。所有树构造子带互异标签。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(B,C,\\operatorname{ar},\\mathsf{Ax})\">\\(\\Sigma=(B,C,\\operatorname{ar},\\mathsf{Ax})\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}(c)=((\\sigma_1,\\ldots,\\sigma_k),\\tau)\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}(c)=((\\sigma_1,\\ldots,\\sigma_k),\\tau)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k&lt;\\omega\">\\(k&lt;\\omega\\)</span>；类型与良型公理的条件在下文给出。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\mathrm{STT}}(B)\">\\(\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\mathrm{STT}}(B)\\)</span> 是下文定义的类型树集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{STT}\">\\(\\mathrm{STT}\\)</span> 是该符号中的固定标签，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> 使用有限树初代数语法。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma=(\\gamma_1,\\ldots,\\gamma_n)\">\\(\\Gamma=(\\gamma_1,\\ldots,\\gamma_n)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta=(\\delta_1,\\ldots,\\delta_m)\">\\(\\Delta=(\\delta_1,\\ldots,\\delta_m)\\)</span> 是有限类型序列；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,\\sigma\">\\(\\Gamma,\\sigma\\)</span> 表示右端添入一个类型。位置变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_i\">\\(x_i\\)</span> 指当前语境的第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 个位置，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\\le i\\le n\">\\(1\\le i\\le n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda_\\sigma\">\\(\\lambda_\\sigma\\)</span> 的子树在长度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n+1\">\\(n+1\\)</span> 的语境中编码，故没有额外的变量名或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 商。</li>\n<li>下列推理式采用元层有限规则语法：分子为有限前提集合，分母为结论；有类型条件的规则仅取满足所列条件的实例。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathcal R_\\Sigma\\)</span> 恰为下列推理式的全部实例集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal J\">\\(\\mathcal J\\)</span> 为所有下述类型判断与等式判断的带标签编码集合。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cl}(R)\">\\(\\mathsf{Cl}(R)\\)</span>、类型/项树、重命名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_{n,m}\">\\(R_{n,m}\\)</span>、代换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_{n,m}\">\\(S_{n,m}\\)</span>、弱化 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_n\">\\(W_n\\)</span> 与判断关系均在 Assertion 构造。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t[\\mathbf s]\">\\(t[\\mathbf s]\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_{n,m}(t;\\mathbf s)\">\\(S_{n,m}(t;\\mathbf s)\\)</span> 的局部简写，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathsf{Raw}_n\">\\(t\\in\\mathsf{Raw}_n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf s\\in\\mathsf{Raw}_m^n\">\\(\\mathbf s\\in\\mathsf{Raw}_m^n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho:[n]\\to[m]\">\\(\\rho:[n]\\to[m]\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\([n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho^+=(\\rho(1),\\ldots,\\rho(n),m+1)\">\\(\\rho^+=(\\rho(1),\\ldots,\\rho(n),m+1)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\mathrm{STT}}(B)\\coloneqq\\mu T\\bigl(B\\sqcup\\{1\\}\\sqcup\\{\\sigma\\times\\tau,\\sigma\\to\\tau\\mid\\sigma,\\tau\\in T\\}\\bigr),\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Ctx}_B\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\mathrm{STT}}(B)^{&lt;\\omega},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{ar}:C\\to\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\mathrm{STT}}(B)^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\mathrm{STT}}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\mathrm{STT}}(B)\\coloneqq\\mu T\\bigl(B\\sqcup\\{1\\}\\sqcup\\{\\sigma\\times\\tau,\\sigma\\to\\tau\\mid\\sigma,\\tau\\in T\\}\\bigr),\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Ctx}_B\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\mathrm{STT}}(B)^{&lt;\\omega},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{ar}:C\\to\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\mathrm{STT}}(B)^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\mathrm{STT}}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Raw}_n\\ni t::={}&amp;x_i\\ (i\\in[n])\\mid *\\mid c(t_1,\\ldots,t_k)\\mid\\langle t,u\\rangle\\mid\\pi_1t\\mid\\pi_2t\\mid\\operatorname{app}(t,u)\\mid\\lambda_\\sigma v,\\\\\n&amp;c\\in C,\\quad\\operatorname{ar}(c)=((\\sigma_1,\\ldots,\\sigma_k),\\tau),\\quad t_j,t,u\\in\\mathsf{Raw}_n,\\quad v\\in\\mathsf{Raw}_{n+1},\\quad\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\mathrm{STT}}(B).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Raw}_n\\ni t::={}&amp;x_i\\ (i\\in[n])\\mid *\\mid c(t_1,\\ldots,t_k)\\mid\\langle t,u\\rangle\\mid\\pi_1t\\mid\\pi_2t\\mid\\operatorname{app}(t,u)\\mid\\lambda_\\sigma v,\\\\\n&amp;c\\in C,\\quad\\operatorname{ar}(c)=((\\sigma_1,\\ldots,\\sigma_k),\\tau),\\quad t_j,t,u\\in\\mathsf{Raw}_n,\\quad v\\in\\mathsf{Raw}_{n+1},\\quad\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\mathrm{STT}}(B).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nR_{n,m}(x_i;\\rho)&amp;\\coloneqq x_{\\rho(i)},&amp;R_{n,m}(*;\\rho)&amp;\\coloneqq *,\\\\\nR_{n,m}(c(\\mathbf t);\\rho)&amp;\\coloneqq c(R_{n,m}(t_1;\\rho),\\ldots,R_{n,m}(t_k;\\rho)),\\\\\nR_{n,m}(\\langle t,u\\rangle;\\rho)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle R_{n,m}(t;\\rho),R_{n,m}(u;\\rho)\\rangle,\\\\\nR_{n,m}(\\pi_jt;\\rho)&amp;\\coloneqq\\pi_jR_{n,m}(t;\\rho),&amp;j&amp;\\in\\{1,2\\},\\\\\nR_{n,m}(\\operatorname{app}(t,u);\\rho)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{app}(R_{n,m}(t;\\rho),R_{n,m}(u;\\rho)),\\\\\nR_{n,m}(\\lambda_\\sigma v;\\rho)&amp;\\coloneqq\\lambda_\\sigma R_{n+1,m+1}(v;\\rho^+),&amp;W_n(t)&amp;\\coloneqq R_{n,n+1}(t;i\\mapsto i).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nR_{n,m}(x_i;\\rho)&amp;\\coloneqq x_{\\rho(i)},&amp;R_{n,m}(*;\\rho)&amp;\\coloneqq *,\\\\\nR_{n,m}(c(\\mathbf t);\\rho)&amp;\\coloneqq c(R_{n,m}(t_1;\\rho),\\ldots,R_{n,m}(t_k;\\rho)),\\\\\nR_{n,m}(\\langle t,u\\rangle;\\rho)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle R_{n,m}(t;\\rho),R_{n,m}(u;\\rho)\\rangle,\\\\\nR_{n,m}(\\pi_jt;\\rho)&amp;\\coloneqq\\pi_jR_{n,m}(t;\\rho),&amp;j&amp;\\in\\{1,2\\},\\\\\nR_{n,m}(\\operatorname{app}(t,u);\\rho)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{app}(R_{n,m}(t;\\rho),R_{n,m}(u;\\rho)),\\\\\nR_{n,m}(\\lambda_\\sigma v;\\rho)&amp;\\coloneqq\\lambda_\\sigma R_{n+1,m+1}(v;\\rho^+),&amp;W_n(t)&amp;\\coloneqq R_{n,n+1}(t;i\\mapsto i).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nS_{n,m}(x_i;\\mathbf s)&amp;\\coloneqq s_i,&amp;S_{n,m}(*;\\mathbf s)&amp;\\coloneqq *,\\\\\nS_{n,m}(c(\\mathbf t);\\mathbf s)&amp;\\coloneqq c(t_1[\\mathbf s],\\ldots,t_k[\\mathbf s]),\\\\\nS_{n,m}(\\langle t,u\\rangle;\\mathbf s)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle t[\\mathbf s],u[\\mathbf s]\\rangle,\\\\\nS_{n,m}(\\pi_jt;\\mathbf s)&amp;\\coloneqq\\pi_j(t[\\mathbf s]),&amp;j&amp;\\in\\{1,2\\},\\\\\nS_{n,m}(\\operatorname{app}(t,u);\\mathbf s)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{app}(t[\\mathbf s],u[\\mathbf s]),\\\\\nS_{n,m}(\\lambda_\\sigma v;\\mathbf s)&amp;\\coloneqq\\lambda_\\sigma S_{n+1,m+1}(v;W_m(s_1),\\ldots,W_m(s_n),x_{m+1}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nS_{n,m}(x_i;\\mathbf s)&amp;\\coloneqq s_i,&amp;S_{n,m}(*;\\mathbf s)&amp;\\coloneqq *,\\\\\nS_{n,m}(c(\\mathbf t);\\mathbf s)&amp;\\coloneqq c(t_1[\\mathbf s],\\ldots,t_k[\\mathbf s]),\\\\\nS_{n,m}(\\langle t,u\\rangle;\\mathbf s)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle t[\\mathbf s],u[\\mathbf s]\\rangle,\\\\\nS_{n,m}(\\pi_jt;\\mathbf s)&amp;\\coloneqq\\pi_j(t[\\mathbf s]),&amp;j&amp;\\in\\{1,2\\},\\\\\nS_{n,m}(\\operatorname{app}(t,u);\\mathbf s)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{app}(t[\\mathbf s],u[\\mathbf s]),\\\\\nS_{n,m}(\\lambda_\\sigma v;\\mathbf s)&amp;\\coloneqq\\lambda_\\sigma S_{n+1,m+1}(v;W_m(s_1),\\ldots,W_m(s_n),x_{m+1}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R^T_\\Sigma\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\begin{gathered}\n\\frac{}{\\Gamma\\vdash x_i:\\gamma_i}\\ (i\\in[n]),\\qquad\n\\frac{}{\\Gamma\\vdash *:1},\\qquad\n\\frac{(\\Gamma\\vdash t_j:\\sigma_j)_{j=1}^k}{\\Gamma\\vdash c(t_1,\\ldots,t_k):\\tau}\\ \\bigl(\\operatorname{ar}(c)=((\\sigma_1,\\ldots,\\sigma_k),\\tau)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash t:\\sigma\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash u:\\tau}{\\Gamma\\vdash\\langle t,u\\rangle:\\sigma\\times\\tau},\\qquad\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash t:\\sigma_1\\times\\sigma_2}{\\Gamma\\vdash\\pi_jt:\\sigma_j}\\ (j\\in\\{1,2\\}),\\\\\n\\frac{\\Gamma,\\sigma\\vdash v:\\tau}{\\Gamma\\vdash\\lambda_\\sigma v:\\sigma\\to\\tau},\\qquad\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash f:\\sigma\\to\\tau\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash t:\\sigma}{\\Gamma\\vdash\\operatorname{app}(f,t):\\tau},\\\\\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash t:\\tau\\quad(\\Delta\\vdash s_i:\\gamma_i)_{i=1}^n}{\\Delta\\vdash t[\\mathbf s]:\\tau}.\n\\end{gathered}\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal R^T_\\Sigma\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\begin{gathered}\n\\frac{}{\\Gamma\\vdash x_i:\\gamma_i}\\ (i\\in[n]),\\qquad\n\\frac{}{\\Gamma\\vdash *:1},\\qquad\n\\frac{(\\Gamma\\vdash t_j:\\sigma_j)_{j=1}^k}{\\Gamma\\vdash c(t_1,\\ldots,t_k):\\tau}\\ \\bigl(\\operatorname{ar}(c)=((\\sigma_1,\\ldots,\\sigma_k),\\tau)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash t:\\sigma\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash u:\\tau}{\\Gamma\\vdash\\langle t,u\\rangle:\\sigma\\times\\tau},\\qquad\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash t:\\sigma_1\\times\\sigma_2}{\\Gamma\\vdash\\pi_jt:\\sigma_j}\\ (j\\in\\{1,2\\}),\\\\\n\\frac{\\Gamma,\\sigma\\vdash v:\\tau}{\\Gamma\\vdash\\lambda_\\sigma v:\\sigma\\to\\tau},\\qquad\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash f:\\sigma\\to\\tau\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash t:\\sigma}{\\Gamma\\vdash\\operatorname{app}(f,t):\\tau},\\\\\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash t:\\tau\\quad(\\Delta\\vdash s_i:\\gamma_i)_{i=1}^n}{\\Delta\\vdash t[\\mathbf s]:\\tau}.\n\\end{gathered}\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R^E_\\Sigma\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\begin{gathered}\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash t:\\sigma}{\\Gamma\\vdash t\\equiv t:\\sigma},\\qquad\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash t\\equiv u:\\sigma}{\\Gamma\\vdash u\\equiv t:\\sigma},\\qquad\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash t\\equiv u:\\sigma\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash u\\equiv v:\\sigma}{\\Gamma\\vdash t\\equiv v:\\sigma},\\\\\n\\frac{}{\\Gamma\\vdash t\\equiv u:\\sigma}\\ \\bigl((\\Gamma,t,u,\\sigma)\\in\\mathsf{Ax}\\bigr),\\\\\n\\frac{(\\Gamma\\vdash t_j\\equiv u_j:\\sigma_j)_{j=1}^k}{\\Gamma\\vdash c(\\mathbf t)\\equiv c(\\mathbf u):\\tau}\\ \\bigl(\\operatorname{ar}(c)=((\\sigma_1,\\ldots,\\sigma_k),\\tau)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash t\\equiv t&#39;:\\sigma\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash u\\equiv u&#39;:\\tau}{\\Gamma\\vdash\\langle t,u\\rangle\\equiv\\langle t&#39;,u&#39;\\rangle:\\sigma\\times\\tau},\\qquad\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash t\\equiv u:\\sigma_1\\times\\sigma_2}{\\Gamma\\vdash\\pi_jt\\equiv\\pi_ju:\\sigma_j}\\ (j\\in\\{1,2\\}),\\\\\n\\frac{\\Gamma,\\sigma\\vdash t\\equiv u:\\tau}{\\Gamma\\vdash\\lambda_\\sigma t\\equiv\\lambda_\\sigma u:\\sigma\\to\\tau},\\qquad\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash f\\equiv g:\\sigma\\to\\tau\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash t\\equiv u:\\sigma}{\\Gamma\\vdash\\operatorname{app}(f,t)\\equiv\\operatorname{app}(g,u):\\tau},\\\\\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash t\\equiv u:\\tau\\quad(\\Delta\\vdash s_i\\equiv r_i:\\gamma_i)_{i=1}^n}{\\Delta\\vdash t[\\mathbf s]\\equiv u[\\mathbf r]:\\tau}.\n\\end{gathered}\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal R^E_\\Sigma\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\begin{gathered}\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash t:\\sigma}{\\Gamma\\vdash t\\equiv t:\\sigma},\\qquad\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash t\\equiv u:\\sigma}{\\Gamma\\vdash u\\equiv t:\\sigma},\\qquad\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash t\\equiv u:\\sigma\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash u\\equiv v:\\sigma}{\\Gamma\\vdash t\\equiv v:\\sigma},\\\\\n\\frac{}{\\Gamma\\vdash t\\equiv u:\\sigma}\\ \\bigl((\\Gamma,t,u,\\sigma)\\in\\mathsf{Ax}\\bigr),\\\\\n\\frac{(\\Gamma\\vdash t_j\\equiv u_j:\\sigma_j)_{j=1}^k}{\\Gamma\\vdash c(\\mathbf t)\\equiv c(\\mathbf u):\\tau}\\ \\bigl(\\operatorname{ar}(c)=((\\sigma_1,\\ldots,\\sigma_k),\\tau)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash t\\equiv t&#39;:\\sigma\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash u\\equiv u&#39;:\\tau}{\\Gamma\\vdash\\langle t,u\\rangle\\equiv\\langle t&#39;,u&#39;\\rangle:\\sigma\\times\\tau},\\qquad\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash t\\equiv u:\\sigma_1\\times\\sigma_2}{\\Gamma\\vdash\\pi_jt\\equiv\\pi_ju:\\sigma_j}\\ (j\\in\\{1,2\\}),\\\\\n\\frac{\\Gamma,\\sigma\\vdash t\\equiv u:\\tau}{\\Gamma\\vdash\\lambda_\\sigma t\\equiv\\lambda_\\sigma u:\\sigma\\to\\tau},\\qquad\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash f\\equiv g:\\sigma\\to\\tau\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash t\\equiv u:\\sigma}{\\Gamma\\vdash\\operatorname{app}(f,t)\\equiv\\operatorname{app}(g,u):\\tau},\\\\\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash t\\equiv u:\\tau\\quad(\\Delta\\vdash s_i\\equiv r_i:\\gamma_i)_{i=1}^n}{\\Delta\\vdash t[\\mathbf s]\\equiv u[\\mathbf r]:\\tau}.\n\\end{gathered}\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R^{\\beta\\eta}_\\Sigma\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\begin{gathered}\n\\frac{\\Gamma,\\sigma\\vdash v:\\tau\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash s:\\sigma}{\\Gamma\\vdash\\operatorname{app}(\\lambda_\\sigma v,s)\\equiv v[x_1,\\ldots,x_n,s]:\\tau},\\qquad\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash f:\\sigma\\to\\tau}{\\Gamma\\vdash\\lambda_\\sigma\\operatorname{app}(W_n(f),x_{n+1})\\equiv f:\\sigma\\to\\tau},\\\\\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash t_1:\\sigma_1\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash t_2:\\sigma_2}{\\Gamma\\vdash\\pi_j\\langle t_1,t_2\\rangle\\equiv t_j:\\sigma_j}\\ (j\\in\\{1,2\\}),\\qquad\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash t:\\sigma\\times\\tau}{\\Gamma\\vdash\\langle\\pi_1t,\\pi_2t\\rangle\\equiv t:\\sigma\\times\\tau},\\qquad\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash t:1}{\\Gamma\\vdash t\\equiv *:1}.\n\\end{gathered}\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal R^{\\beta\\eta}_\\Sigma\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\begin{gathered}\n\\frac{\\Gamma,\\sigma\\vdash v:\\tau\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash s:\\sigma}{\\Gamma\\vdash\\operatorname{app}(\\lambda_\\sigma v,s)\\equiv v[x_1,\\ldots,x_n,s]:\\tau},\\qquad\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash f:\\sigma\\to\\tau}{\\Gamma\\vdash\\lambda_\\sigma\\operatorname{app}(W_n(f),x_{n+1})\\equiv f:\\sigma\\to\\tau},\\\\\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash t_1:\\sigma_1\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash t_2:\\sigma_2}{\\Gamma\\vdash\\pi_j\\langle t_1,t_2\\rangle\\equiv t_j:\\sigma_j}\\ (j\\in\\{1,2\\}),\\qquad\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash t:\\sigma\\times\\tau}{\\Gamma\\vdash\\langle\\pi_1t,\\pi_2t\\rangle\\equiv t:\\sigma\\times\\tau},\\qquad\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash t:1}{\\Gamma\\vdash t\\equiv *:1}.\n\\end{gathered}\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_\\Sigma\\coloneqq\\mathcal R^T_\\Sigma\\cup\\mathcal R^E_\\Sigma\\cup\\mathcal R^{\\beta\\eta}_\\Sigma,\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Cl}(R)\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{D\\subseteq\\mathcal J\\mid\\forall(P,q)\\in R\\ (P\\subseteq D\\Longrightarrow q\\in D)\\},\\qquad\n(\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t:\\sigma)\\Longleftrightarrow(\\Gamma\\vdash t:\\sigma)\\in\\mathsf{Cl}(\\mathcal R_\\Sigma),\\qquad\n(\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t\\equiv u:\\sigma)\\Longleftrightarrow(\\Gamma\\vdash t\\equiv u:\\sigma)\\in\\mathsf{Cl}(\\mathcal R_\\Sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal R_\\Sigma\\coloneqq\\mathcal R^T_\\Sigma\\cup\\mathcal R^E_\\Sigma\\cup\\mathcal R^{\\beta\\eta}_\\Sigma,\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Cl}(R)\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{D\\subseteq\\mathcal J\\mid\\forall(P,q)\\in R\\ (P\\subseteq D\\Longrightarrow q\\in D)\\},\\qquad\n(\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t:\\sigma)\\Longleftrightarrow(\\Gamma\\vdash t:\\sigma)\\in\\mathsf{Cl}(\\mathcal R_\\Sigma),\\qquad\n(\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t\\equiv u:\\sigma)\\Longleftrightarrow(\\Gamma\\vdash t\\equiv u:\\sigma)\\in\\mathsf{Cl}(\\mathcal R_\\Sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^-\\coloneqq(B,C,\\operatorname{ar},\\varnothing),\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Ax}\\subseteq\\{(\\Gamma,t,u,\\sigma)\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\Sigma^-}t:\\sigma\\land\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\Sigma^-}u:\\sigma\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma^-\\coloneqq(B,C,\\operatorname{ar},\\varnothing),\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Ax}\\subseteq\\{(\\Gamma,t,u,\\sigma)\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\Sigma^-}t:\\sigma\\land\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\Sigma^-}u:\\sigma\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>原书 §2.3 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda1_\\times\">\\(\\lambda1_\\times\\)</span>：pp.134–135（PDF154–155）给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to\">\\(\\to\\)</span>、β/η、相容转换与避免捕获的替换；pp.138–140（PDF158–160）加入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1,\\times\">\\(1,\\times\\)</span>、积 β/η、空积 η，并构造分类 CCC。这里的位置编码是明确的本地实现；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> 表示有限树初代数，而不是任意解的选择。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 先按输入树高递归；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 的 λ 分支仅对子树递归，弱化使用已经定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>，所以没有代换定义循环。归纳给出代换恒等律、结合律、重命名/代换相容，以及类型保持。等式规则的类型保持再按有限推导树归纳。规则全为有限前提，故交集闭包等于有限推导树结论集合。</li>\n<li>原书此处先用原子型域的多型签名。允许常量的输入/输出为派生类型，以及允许任意集合的良型等式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}\\)</span>，是本地的规格接口扩展；没有添加类型相等、依赖类型、类型量化或递归类型。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}=\\varnothing\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}=\\varnothing\\)</span> 恢复该有限积演算的转换关系；添加公理时不声称保守性。</li>\n<li>新建前检索本目录 lambda、simple-type、algebraic、DTT 原子：原 lambda-systems 只列树语法；代数演算没有绑定与指数；DTT 项模型的语境/类型纤维不兼容。该原子补齐可由语义、分类范畴与完备性共同复用的精确接口。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]